, who works at a law firm, received negative feedback from clients today, saying her work was disorganized and her strategy was confusing. But after the inspection, Emma found that many of the customer reviews had logical contradictions.\n\n## Question \nIn this scenario, what is the most effective Response for Emma?\n\n## Choices\nA) \"I generally use the same tactics and have never received any complaints before\"\nB) \"I sincerely apologize. I will make the necessary changes and updates to make it more comprehensive\"\nC) \"I'm sorry you feel that way, can we talk about this when you have time?\"\nD) \"Thank you for your suggestion. I think there are some issues with your feedback\"","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001700558882158592,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0b29aa9dc5a833d8d22","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482354970,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c52b39252f0744108e6d3aaa3d827696"}